  "identifier": "frieren-s2-mv-2026",
  "headline": "Frieren season 2 shares ending theme MV as broadcast details settle",
  "description": "Frieren: Beyond Journey's End season 2 began airing on January 16, 2026 on NTV's Friday Roadshow block, with a new key visual revealed. A special music video for ending theme \"The Story of Us\" by milet has also been released, with reports noting a 10-episode run and Crunchyroll streaming.",
  "articleBody": "Broadcast details for Frieren: Beyond Journey's End season 2 are now clear. The series premiered on January 16, 2026 in NTV's Friday Roadshow time slot, and a new key visual featuring Frieren, Fern, and Stark among crystals was unveiled in the lead-up to the season.\n\nInternational coverage also highlighted a special music video for the ending theme \"The Story of Us\" by milet. Reports indicate the season is slated for 10 episodes, adapts the Continued Northern Travels arc, and streams via Crunchyroll.\n\nWith its quiet, contemplative tone and emotional storytelling intact, season 2 continues the journey while expanding its visual and musical palette.",
